          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko aca ambwira ati: “Iri ni ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " utumwe kubwira Zerubabeli uti: ‘Si ku bw’inkomezi canke ku bw’ubushobozi, ariko ni ku bwa Mpwemu wanje,’ ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
